        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5022] The SECC shall respond with a WPT_ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes with the ResponseCode = FAILED when the element values received from the EVCC do not allow a system setup for any power transfer at the supply device.",
