        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5066] The SECC shall respond with a WPT_ChargeParameterDiscoveryRes with the ResponseCode = WARNING_WPT when the element values received from the EVCC only allow a system setup for limited (significantly lower) power transfer at the supply device.",
